{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48218","headline":"始平谐诗 · 石抱忠","name":"始平谐诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平明发始平，薄暮至何城。\n库墖朝云上，晃池夜月明。\n略彴桥头逢长史，棂星门外揖司兵。\n一羣县尉驴骡骤，数个参军鹅鸭行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"石抱忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}